  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): umbrella as filed enrolled 9 members from the dogfood_umbrella_member tag set, but at least 7 `dogfood_singleton` and non-dogfood active items instantiate this META's mechanic and should be folded as additional members: WI-furop (sketch --require-section), INV-fapid (slice --out argparse-default collision), INV-toniv (search negative limits), INV-bitig (verify-claims must_not_exist on empty dir, P0), INV-hukug (verify-claims --taint-sources override gap), INV-sozop (--input wrong-shape traceback), INV-zurih (verify-claims malformed YAML traceback). The umbrella's deeper-issue framing is \"no parser-layer validator stage in the architecture\" — same root absence as INV-numat (emission-vocabulary validator) and INV-kurup (emission-identifier validator); the three may share a future super-META."  # 6cd0
